{"id":"dec-0002","date":"2026-08-10","source":"manual-review","book":"anonymous-technical-book","scene":"other","finding":"long-mathml-in-data-table-overflow","context":{"structure":"real-data-table-with-rowspan-and-mathml","reader":"readest","reader_version":"0.11.20 (20260720.043916)","artifact":"anonymous-production-sample-v3.1.epub#sha256=d10243cd21fb691b49de13c3ce086503dff3ab16fdbcc884013a5bef4ca0b78e"},"candidates":["preserve-structure-and-tune-scoped-math-size","wrap-formulas-with-horizontal-scroll","use-max-content-formula-wrapper"],"chosen":"preserve-structure-and-tune-scoped-math-size","rationale":"先保留真实跨行关系、列宽和公式结构，只在该表作用域内逐级调整 MathML 相对字号；Readest 实测修复了目标大字号截断，未把单书字号值外推为通用常量。","scope":"global","reusable":true}
{"id":"dec-0003","date":"2026-08-10","source":"manual-review","book":"anonymous-technical-book","scene":"image-layout","finding":"generic-image-width-overrides-instance-width","context":{"selector":".repaired-vector img","structure":"single-percentage-width-and-asymmetric-figure-pairs","reader":"kindle_previewer","reader_version":"3.106","artifact":"anonymous-production-sample-v3.1.epub#sha256=d10243cd21fb691b49de13c3ce086503dff3ab16fdbcc884013a5bef4ca0b78e"},"candidates":["preserve-instance-percentage-widths","force-all-repaired-images-to-100-percent","compensate-inside-image-assets"],"chosen":"preserve-instance-percentage-widths","rationale":"通用规则只限制最大宽度和高度，展示宽度由 figure 或单图作用域决定；并排比例按源图框设置，避免宽泛 width:100% 和图内视觉缩放覆盖单图意图。","scope":"global","reusable":true}
{"id":"dec-0004","date":"2026-08-13","source":"manual-review","book":"anonymous-english-illustrated-anthology","scene":"css-layering","finding":"english-prose-body-and-display-roles-compete","context":{"classes":[".english-fiction",".chapter-head",".en-large-initial",".literary-song",".literary-lullaby",".story-sign",".chapter-figure",".illustration",".img-left",".img-right"],"structure":"multi-volume-reflowable-english-prose-with-chapter-art-role-text-and-illustrations","artifact":"anonymous-english-illustrated-anthology-typeset-v1.1"},"candidates":["lock-body-and-apply-display-face-broadly","keep-body-reader-selectable-and-scope-display-faces-by-structure","use-one-display-face-for-all-non-body-text"],"chosen":"keep-body-reader-selectable-and-scope-display-faces-by-structure","rationale":"人工验收认为当前整体英文排版效果良好；正文保留阅读器字号和字体选择，嵌入字体只作用于章题、章首字、诗歌、签名或独立展示文字，图片宽度与绕排继续由 figure 角色控制。可复用的是角色分层方法，不外推本书字号、宽度、字体或首字实现。","scope":"global","reusable":true}
{"id":"dec-0005","date":"2026-11-03","source":"manual-review","book":"","scene":"image-layout","finding":"png-alpha-url-shape-unreliable","context":{"structure":"reflowable-side-figure-transparent-png-continuous-prose","readers":["chrome-desktop"],"reader_version":"156.0.8078.80"},"candidates":["keep-explicit-polygon-content-box","switch-to-png-alpha-url-shape"],"chosen":"keep-explicit-polygon-content-box","rationale":"用户查看浏览器左右对照后判定 PNG alpha 的 url() 方式不理想，决定仍用显式 polygon 主路径。实测 Chrome 对非替换 figure 上的 url() alpha 不按显示尺寸缩放，须把 float 与 shape-outside 一起移到 img 上才对齐；该结构还要重做 figure 语义、矩形回退和窄屏护栏，阅读器支持未经实测，历史 alpha 试验在 Apple Books 退回矩形。因此不采用 url(image)，不在生产配方中引入。","scope":"global","reusable":true}
{"id":"dec-0006","date":"2026-11-03","source":"reader-test","book":"","scene":"css-layering","finding":"root-font-size-blocks-reader-scaling","context":{"structure":"reflowable-book-css-declares-font-size-on-html-or-reset-list","readers":["reeden"],"reader_version":"long-running test build; exact version not recorded","probe":"templates/font-scale-probe#sha256=ff289b9ec2e01b1ed213e0653b331171e1a2e355b947aad74a36ac44a31a6958"},"candidates":["remove-font-size-from-html-root-universal","keep-and-add-reader-specific-branch","remove-body-font-size-too"],"chosen":"remove-font-size-from-html-root-universal","rationale":"两本匿名存量书在部分阅读器无法调字号，删除 html / reset 列表上的 font-size: 100% 后恢复。合成探针在 Reeden 测试版上只有 html { font-size: 100% } 页不放大，body 1em / 100%、section 1em 与 p 16px 页均放大（用户口述，无截图，reader-matrix 记 warn）。删除根元素字号对所有阅读器无副作用，因此作为通用规则，不写 Reeden 专用分支；body 上的相对字号未复现问题，只作 info 提示。nav audit 以 css-root-font-size error 阻断书级构建。","scope":"global","reusable":true}
